#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.4.rst:4
msgid "v2.6.4"
msgstr "v2.6.4"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.4.rst:6
msgid ""
"v2.6.4 brings full Arduino Portenta H7 support, a generic DFU bootloader-"
"detection and flashing workflow, and a set of Edge Impulse dataset "
"improvements. It is built on Qt Creator 4.0.2 (unchanged from the previous "
"release) and contains no breaking changes for existing projects."
msgstr ""
"v2.6.4 apporte une prise en charge complète de l'Arduino Portenta H7, un "
"flux de travail générique de détection de programme d'amorçage DFU et de "
"flashage, ainsi qu'un ensemble d'améliorations des jeux de données Edge "
"Impulse. Elle est construite sur Qt Creator 4.0.2 (inchangé par rapport à la"
" version précédente) et ne contient aucun changement incompatible pour les "
"projets existants."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.4.rst:14
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Sur cette page"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.4.rst:17
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Points marquants"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.4.rst:19
msgid ""
"**Arduino Portenta H7** is now fully supported, including DFU-mode firmware "
"flashing via ``dfu-util`` so the board can be programmed straight from "
"OpenMV IDE."
msgstr ""
"L'**Arduino Portenta H7** est désormais entièrement pris en charge, y "
"compris le flashage du micrologiciel en mode DFU via ``dfu-util``, ce qui "
"permet de programmer la carte directement depuis OpenMV IDE."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.4.rst:22
msgid ""
"**DFU bootloader detection** adds a *DFU bootloader(s) found* dialog "
"offering *Reset Firmware to Release Version*, *Load Specific Firmware File*,"
" or *Erase Onboard Data Flash*."
msgstr ""
"La **détection du programme d'amorçage DFU** ajoute une boîte de dialogue "
"*DFU bootloader(s) found* proposant *Reset Firmware to Release Version*, "
"*Load Specific Firmware File* ou *Erase Onboard Data Flash*."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.4.rst:25
msgid ""
"**DFU programming engine** driven by a new ``dfu.txt`` flashes both raw "
"``.bin`` and packaged ``.dfu`` firmware with per-board commands and serial-"
"number targeting."
msgstr ""
"Le **moteur de programmation DFU**, piloté par un nouveau ``dfu.txt``, "
"flashe à la fois le micrologiciel brut ``.bin`` et le micrologiciel "
"empaqueté ``.dfu`` avec des commandes par carte et un ciblage par numéro de "
"série."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.4.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Edge Impulse uploads** now accept PNG and BMP images alongside JPG/JPEG, "
"report upload statistics on completion, and no longer freeze the UI."
msgstr ""
"Les **téléversements Edge Impulse** acceptent désormais les images PNG et "
"BMP en plus de JPG/JPEG, rapportent des statistiques de téléversement à la "
"fin et ne figent plus l'interface."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.4.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Smaller download** after removing large prebuilt ``.elf`` firmware files "
"and unused submodules from the bundle."
msgstr ""
"**Téléchargement plus léger** après la suppression des volumineux fichiers "
"de micrologiciel ``.elf`` précompilés et des sous-modules inutilisés du "
"paquet."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.4.rst:34
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Nouvelles fonctionnalités"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.4.rst:36
msgid ""
"**Arduino Portenta H7** support with a dedicated bootload, erase, and "
"program flow over DFU (device ``2341:035b``), DFU-mode firmware flashing via"
" ``dfu-util``, and the license check disabled for the board (`488efe191 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/488efe191>`__, `8b8090e27 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/8b8090e27>`__, `5195fa5a8 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/5195fa5a8>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Prise en charge de l'**Arduino Portenta H7** avec un flux dédié d'amorçage, "
"d'effacement et de programmation via DFU (périphérique ``2341:035b``), le "
"flashage du micrologiciel en mode DFU via ``dfu-util``, et la vérification "
"de licence désactivée pour cette carte (`488efe191 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/488efe191>`__, `8b8090e27 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/8b8090e27>`__, `5195fa5a8 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/5195fa5a8>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.4.rst:42
msgid ""
"**Generic DFU bootloader detection** lists attached DFU devices via ``dfu-"
"util -l``, adds a device-selection dialog, and presents a three-button *DFU "
"bootloader(s) found* dialog with *Reset Firmware to Release Version*, *Load "
"Specific Firmware File*, and *Erase Onboard Data Flash* (`0106b4687 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/0106b4687>`__, `8b8090e27 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/8b8090e27>`__)."
msgstr ""
"La **détection générique du programme d'amorçage DFU** liste les "
"périphériques DFU connectés via ``dfu-util -l``, ajoute une boîte de "
"dialogue de sélection de périphérique, et présente une boîte de dialogue "
"*DFU bootloader(s) found* à trois boutons avec *Reset Firmware to Release "
"Version*, *Load Specific Firmware File* et *Erase Onboard Data Flash* "
"(`0106b4687 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/0106b4687>`__, "
"`8b8090e27 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/8b8090e27>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.4.rst:48
msgid ""
"**DFU programming engine** driven by a new ``dfu.txt`` that defines per-"
"board ``vidpid``, ``eraseCommands``, ``binProgramCommand``, and "
"``dfuProgramCommand``, flashing both raw ``.bin`` and packaged ``.dfu`` "
"firmware and targeting the board's serial number (`d8274828d "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d8274828d>`__, `33c3c101a "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/33c3c101a>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Le **moteur de programmation DFU**, piloté par un nouveau ``dfu.txt`` qui "
"définit par carte ``vidpid``, ``eraseCommands``, ``binProgramCommand`` et "
"``dfuProgramCommand``, flashe à la fois le micrologiciel brut ``.bin`` et le"
" micrologiciel empaqueté ``.dfu`` et cible le numéro de série de la carte "
"(`d8274828d <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d8274828d>`__, "
"`33c3c101a <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/33c3c101a>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.4.rst:54
msgid ""
"**Frame-skip export** in the Convert/Save Video tools adds a *Skip frames?* "
"option to decimate frames when exporting to ``.bin``, and now requests "
"ffmpeg's highest JPEG quality (``-q:v 1``) (`2c4fd1cb5 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/2c4fd1cb5>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Le **saut de trames à l'exportation** dans les outils Convert/Save Video "
"ajoute une option *Skip frames?* pour décimer les trames lors de "
"l'exportation vers ``.bin``, et demande désormais la meilleure qualité JPEG "
"de ffmpeg (``-q:v 1``) (`2c4fd1cb5 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/2c4fd1cb5>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.4.rst:58
msgid ""
"**Edge Impulse upload statistics** dialog reports files uploaded, responses "
"received, new images added, and images marked as duplicates after an upload "
"completes (`af179e44c <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/af179e44c>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Une boîte de dialogue de **statistiques de téléversement Edge Impulse** "
"rapporte les fichiers téléversés, les réponses reçues, les nouvelles images "
"ajoutées et les images marquées comme doublons une fois le téléversement "
"terminé (`af179e44c <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/af179e44c>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.4.rst:64
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Autres changements et améliorations"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.4.rst:66
msgid ""
"Added a bootloader-entry serial command (``__USBDBG_SYS_RESET_TO_BL``) so "
"Arduino boards reset directly into their DFU bootloader instead of a plain "
"system reset (`9475fd6de <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/9475fd6de>`__, `488efe191 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/488efe191>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Ajout d'une commande série d'entrée dans le programme d'amorçage "
"(``__USBDBG_SYS_RESET_TO_BL``) afin que les cartes Arduino redémarrent "
"directement dans leur programme d'amorçage DFU au lieu d'une simple "
"réinitialisation système (`9475fd6de <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/9475fd6de>`__, `488efe191 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/488efe191>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.4.rst:71
msgid ""
"Edge Impulse dataset uploads now accept PNG and BMP images in addition to "
"JPG/JPEG, match class-folder and numbered snapshot names more flexibly, and "
"convert all images to JPG before uploading (`af179e44c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/af179e44c>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Les téléversements de jeux de données Edge Impulse acceptent désormais les "
"images PNG et BMP en plus de JPG/JPEG, reconnaissent plus souplement les "
"noms de dossiers de classe et les captures numérotées, et convertissent "
"toutes les images en JPG avant le téléversement (`af179e44c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/af179e44c>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.4.rst:75
msgid ""
"A sensor ID of ``0xFF`` is now treated as ``None`` (no camera sensor), the "
"license check is skipped for such boards, and sensor-type detection runs "
"earlier in the connect flow (`138ab3c12 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/138ab3c12>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Un identifiant de capteur de ``0xFF`` est désormais traité comme ``None`` "
"(aucun capteur de caméra), la vérification de licence est ignorée pour de "
"telles cartes, et la détection du type de capteur s'exécute plus tôt dans le"
" flux de connexion (`138ab3c12 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/138ab3c12>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.4.rst:79
msgid ""
"Added Arduino and Edge Impulse partner logos to the About dialog (`138ab3c12"
" <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/138ab3c12>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Ajout des logos des partenaires Arduino et Edge Impulse à la boîte de "
"dialogue À propos (`138ab3c12 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/138ab3c12>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.4.rst:81
msgid ""
"Edge Impulse uploads now handle empty or invalid datasets gracefully, "
"showing a *Nothing to upload* dialog instead of attempting an upload "
"(`cf976b24b <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/cf976b24b>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Les téléversements Edge Impulse gèrent désormais correctement les jeux de "
"données vides ou invalides, en affichant une boîte de dialogue *Nothing to "
"upload* au lieu de tenter un téléversement (`cf976b24b "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/cf976b24b>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.4.rst:84
msgid ""
"Removed large prebuilt ``.elf`` firmware files and the unused ``labview``, "
"``ros``, and ``qtrest`` submodules from the bundle, shrinking the download "
"(`5fa17d9b2 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/5fa17d9b2>`__, "
"`18f28fd5a <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/18f28fd5a>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Suppression des volumineux fichiers de micrologiciel ``.elf`` précompilés et"
" des sous-modules inutilisés ``labview``, ``ros`` et ``qtrest`` du paquet, "
"réduisant ainsi le téléchargement (`5fa17d9b2 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/5fa17d9b2>`__, `18f28fd5a <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/18f28fd5a>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.4.rst:88
msgid ""
"Marked the bundled ``dfu-util`` binaries executable so DFU flashing works on"
" Linux and macOS (`f34a0e80f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/f34a0e80f>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Marquage des binaires ``dfu-util`` fournis comme exécutables afin que le "
"flashage DFU fonctionne sous Linux et macOS (`f34a0e80f "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/f34a0e80f>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.4.rst:93
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Corrections de bogues"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.4.rst:95
msgid ""
"Fixed the IDE lagging and freezing during Edge Impulse dataset uploads by "
"pumping the event loop between network requests (`7568c0713 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/7568c0713>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Correction des ralentissements et blocages de l'IDE pendant les "
"téléversements de jeux de données Edge Impulse, en faisant tourner la boucle"
" d'événements entre les requêtes réseau (`7568c0713 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/7568c0713>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.4.rst:98
msgid ""
"Fixed the Edge Impulse *Edge Impulse Projects* selection dialog to correctly"
" preselect the last-used project (`cf976b24b <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/cf976b24b>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Correction de la boîte de dialogue de sélection *Edge Impulse Projects* "
"d'Edge Impulse afin de présélectionner correctement le dernier projet "
"utilisé (`cf976b24b <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/cf976b24b>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.4.rst:103
msgid "Platform and tool support"
msgstr "Prise en charge des plateformes et des outils"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.4.rst:105
msgid "**Qt Creator base:** 4.0.2."
msgstr "**Base Qt Creator :** 4.0.2."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.4.rst:106
msgid ""
"**New board:** Arduino Portenta H7 (``PORTENTA_H7_8192_SDRAM``, vid:pid "
"``2341:035b``)."
msgstr ""
"**Nouvelle carte :** Arduino Portenta H7 (``PORTENTA_H7_8192_SDRAM``, "
"vid:pid ``2341:035b``)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.4.rst:108
msgid ""
"**Bundled firmware** refreshed for OPENMV2, OPENMV3, OPENMV4, OPENMV4P, and "
"PORTENTA (new ``firmware.bin``/``openmv.bin``/``uvc.bin`` and DFU binaries)."
msgstr ""
"**Micrologiciel fourni** rafraîchi pour OPENMV2, OPENMV3, OPENMV4, OPENMV4P "
"et PORTENTA (nouveaux ``firmware.bin``/``openmv.bin``/``uvc.bin`` et "
"binaires DFU)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.4.rst:112
msgid "Breaking changes"
msgstr "Changements incompatibles"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.4.rst:114
msgid "None. Existing projects and workflows continue to work unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Aucun. Les projets et flux de travail existants continuent de fonctionner "
"sans changement."
